Notes on the two findings worth flagging: BigInt is required, not cosmetic — Python prints `123456789012345678901234567890` exactly. And `--a -7,-6` *fails* in Python (argparse only exempts tokens matching `^-\d+$`), so the port fails identically; the equivalent `--a=-7,-6` works in both. The only output that cannot match is that PyInstaller PID line.
